<p>The images on RingZine articles are AI generated illustrations. They are not photographs. They do not show real events, real people or real products as they actually appeared, and they were not taken at any event we report on.</p>
<p>Each illustration is labelled AI generated. The Source link under the image leads to this page.</p>
<p>Where an article uses a licensed or Creative Commons photograph instead, it is credited under the image with the creator, the licence and a link to the original.</p>
<p>Questions about an image? Write to <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">the desk</a>.</p>
